s**\n\n - Endless zombie survival action\n\n - Funny farmer voice commentary\n\n - Global leaderboard competition\n\n - Comfortable stationary VR gameplay\n\n - Quick pick up and play action\n\n - High replayability\n\n\n**Final Question**\n\nHow long can you survive?", "short_description": "Endless zombie shooter. Survive, shoot, and top the leaderboard."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://xrpanda.ca/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XRPANDA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.xrpanda.ca/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27257084527232506"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "27437033285893859"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1286217549891916"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "846062421874529"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "27437033285893859"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1779236520, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "27437033285893859"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27590613143879641", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "1546606693567049", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only